<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n83740" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλευρ-ῑτικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>suffering from pleurisy,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Aph.</u>
				1.12
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				14.966.7
			</span></i> (Rome, <span class="entity">ii A.D.</span>), <i><span class="en">
				Paul.Aeg.
				3.33
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>good for pleurisy,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δυνάμεις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					11.711
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>causing pleurisy,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ruf.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				5.3.14
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. πυρετός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					17(1).890
				</span></i>
			.</div>
